   "textEn": "At 3:25 P.M., what does Ms. Kaluza most likely mean when she writes, “You got it”? (A) She wants to confirm that Mr. Gollancz understands her. (B) She will be at 210 Leon Drive early Monday morning. (C) She will send Mr. Gruyler a bill for some work. (D) She hopes Mr. Gollancz will contact the Brown family.",
